# Code owners for truenorth-mcp.
#
# GitHub auto-requests a review from the owner on every pull request that changes a
# matching path. The last matching pattern wins. This single catch-all makes the owner
# the reviewer for the whole repository.
#
# Scope note: this repository is a personal (user) account repository. GitHub allows
# per-actor bypass lists only on organization repositories. So the branch protection on
# main keeps 0 required approvals, which lets the owner self-merge. The owner's review is
# auto-requested here but is not a hard merge requirement yet. To require the owner's
# review for other authors while the owner keeps self-merge, move the repository to an
# organization and add a ruleset that requires code-owner review with the owner as a
# bypass actor.

